      <h1>Indian Battery Manufacturers</h1>
      <p class="muted">Manufacturer Directory · Last reviewed 2026-09</p>

      <div class="box">
        <strong>Direct answer:</strong> India's battery industry is a <strong>lead-acid duopoly</strong> —
        <strong>Amara Raja</strong> and <strong>Exide Industries</strong> — built on automotive and industrial
        batteries, now joined by a <strong>PLI-backed lithium build-out</strong> of new cell plants as the
        country pushes EV and storage localisation.
      </div>

